      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目终于回来了。\n我顾不上慰劳立刻先给她的足部做冰敷。\n这期间她聊起来赛后的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b03cd1d2ade9ae5333b9e7ef17818631df3720005c12d965660f675a8fb983f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
