      "uid": "zhcn:c6e18a0d5813d712c47b7779",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一边聊着，一边思考。\n下个目标就定为『日本橡树大赛』了。\n那也是项历史悠久的精彩比赛，但――",
      "source_fingerprint": "2270cb10b41836e255230afcb85421f2d2a1f9bbb86be95e44b26029f09ab655",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
