      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――紧接在『日本橡树大赛』之后举办的，\n比赛界人士的梦想……『日本德比』。\n即便是汇聚了世代最强的比赛，她也能――",
      "source_fingerprint": "6defae17d3b49ed52c1026de7ec2ba4c53bc52b779b5b1ff7047aec65ad6b53c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
