    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fca3b70fb2febe4626837835",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她是伏特加。一位达成草地GⅠ7胜的伟大赛马娘。\n不过她最了不起的伟业是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ee5a5a128adba17fb8f5874dd65c98ae9f90fa6d5dea4ce99533112fbdf8fdd",
